#: setup.php:178
msgid "Enter how many days, weeks or months to keep alert history, or choose Indefinitely to keep everything (the number is then ignored). Maximum 3650 days, 520 weeks or 120 months. A purge job runs with the Cacti poller and removes aged events with their decisions, deliveries and attempts. Active conditions and queued or failed work are never purged. Each collector purges its own history."
msgstr "Ingiza idadi ya siku, wiki au miezi ya kuhifadhi historia ya tahadhari, au chagua Milele ili kuhifadhi kila kitu (nambari itapuuzwa). Kiwango cha juu ni siku 3650, wiki 520 au miezi 120. Kazi ya kusafisha huendeshwa na poller ya Cacti na huondoa matukio ya zamani pamoja na maamuzi, uwasilishaji na majaribio yake. Masharti amilifu na kazi zilizoko kwenye foleni au zilizoshindwa hazisafishwi kamwe. Kila kikusanyaji husafisha historia yake chenyewe."

