#: setup.php:199
msgid "Run processing and delivery workers in the resident Alarm Manager service instead of the Cacti poller. The service must be installed and running; disabling it lets current jobs finish and returns processing to the poller. Changes apply within a few seconds and synchronize to collectors."
msgstr "Endesha wafanyakazi wa uchakataji na uwasilishaji katika huduma ya mkazi ya Alarm Manager badala ya poller ya Cacti. Huduma lazima iwe imesakinishwa na inaendeshwa; kuizima huruhusu kazi za sasa kukamilika na kurejesha uchakataji kwa poller. Mabadiliko hutumika ndani ya sekunde chache na kusawazishwa kwa vikusanyaji."

